Options: (a) they wait docked at 0 cr an hour until First Links has three results and is lifted to the 30 (4,000 cr each, about 120,000 cr once), with the fill gate HALT for them meanwhile; (b) a Trading round trip at Grand Exchange (trade authenticator bid 975 x 1,000, ask 1,025 x 1,000), about -500 cr a ship-hour as the same kind of route measured (train-trading-weapon-housing-node-alpha -510): about -13,500 cr an hour for 27; (c) far_ok for them to the Voidborn home crafts and sells, 19 to 22 jumps.
